  "details": "Switching an Avatar in fullbody takes puts an Avatar into T-pose and requires rebinding. However, Fallback avatars don't need to do this and instead work off of a person's currently bound IK. All avatars are technically capable of this feat, why not make it a toggle in the settings to \"keep IK between avatars\"? People are always free to rebind themselves. The tech is already in game and availible.",
